---
title: Recover your username or password
description: What to do if you forgot your campus password or username.
sidebar:
  order: 6
---

This only applies to **username and password** accounts. If you sign in with Nostr, GitHub or Google, you have no campus password: recover access through that service instead.

## Steps

{% steps %}

1. Open [campus.ismos.xyz/login/forgot_password.php](https://campus.ismos.xyz/login/forgot_password.php) or click **Forgotten your username or password?** on the sign-in page.

2. Enter your **username** or your **email**. Either one is enough.

3. Click **Search**. If an account matches, you will receive an email with a link.

4. Open the link (it expires after 30 minutes) and choose a new password.

{% /steps %}

## If the email does not arrive

- Check your **spam** folder.
- For security, the campus answers the same way whether or not the account exists. If nothing arrives, try your other email or your username.
- If you created the account with **Nostr, GitHub or Google**, there is no password to recover: sign in with that method again.
- Still stuck? Contact us with the email you think you registered with and we will look into it.

## Changing your password without having forgotten it

While signed in, open your user menu (top right) → **Preferences** → **Change password**.
